    <p class="eyebrow">The Origin</p>
    <p class="body-lg" style="margin-bottom: 28px;">Kun Bloom was born in Chongqing&rsquo;s industrial heartland &mdash; a city where mountains meet rivers and architecture must contend with extremes. That environment shaped our thinking: materials should not just survive conditions, they should transcend them.</p>
    <p class="body-lg" style="margin-bottom: 28px;">Over 15 years, we have grown from a regional tile manufacturer into a nationally recognized brand serving architects, developers, and design studios across China, Southeast Asia, and the Middle East. Our R&amp;D center holds 14 national utility model and invention patents covering raw material formulation, kiln temperature control, and surface finishing processes.</p>
    <p class="body-lg">We are ISO 9001 certified, ISO 14001 compliant, and recognized as an AAA-rated enterprise by China&rsquo;s national credit system.</p>
  </div>
</section>

